Cell["3. Reading the result", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5d27c444-f355-451c-9bc3-58be59ae0812"],

Cell["\<\
The planar graph has 25 physical HRs (13 interior and 12 codimension one), \
with two HRs admitting different W_SL/depth presentations. The same-path \
hexagon--pentagon has 9 physical HRs (3 interior and 6 codimension one), all \
with a single presentation. The separate-path graph has no staged candidate \
and remains at zero. These records are ready for review, but this notebook \
deliberately leaves Table 8 unchanged.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9fc70c4e-f88d-486c-8a0b-cabe0f09dbd4"]
},
